yxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 07-12-2019, 01:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-10T19:28:04-07:00","id":1317725,"title":"","content":"The Nexus is coming?! Oh god(s), we're all doomed--run for your lives! Don't bother rescuing your children, as they'll only slow you down; I suggest....<br /> <br /> [Looks into what the Storypath Nexus actually is.]<br /> <br /> Oh. Well, that's not as bad as I feared. In fact, it's kind of cool!<br /> <br /> <b>Ahem.</b> As you were.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25347-sheeted-kid","name":"Sheeted Kid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25347_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-10T21:13:47-07:00","id":1317740,"title":"","content":"Well, time to start working on my &quot;German folklore in Scion&quot; thing...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/sunkencastles\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Sunken Castles, Evil Poodles</b></a> is creating Public Domain translations of German folklore!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://german-geek.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>A German Geek</b></a> - my gaming blog!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10279-j\u00fcrgen-hubert","name":"J\u00fcrgen Hubert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-11T05:26:38-07:00","id":1317779,"title":"","content":"I probably won't get around to writing it, but I'm sure there's a market for pre-written conditions, especially for injuries.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-11T10:42:15-07:00","id":1317835,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1317779#post1317779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I probably won't get around to writing it, but I'm sure there's a market for pre-written conditions, especially for injuries.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, probably not injuries. They're just cute names for wounds decided on the spot with their penalties equal to the tank of the injury","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-11T10:53:35-07:00","id":1317837,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1317835#post1317835\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eh, probably not injuries. They're just cute names for wounds decided on the spot with their penalties equal to the tank of the injury</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree, but a decent amount of questions I've seen about the system have involved injuries and their conditions. I could easily see people wanting to roll on some kind of table to see what kind of injury was inflicted, though. A few different tables for each injury level would probably be popular.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-11T11:04:33-07:00","id":1317838,"title":"","content":"So Mal\u2019akhim (and the Legio) first. Novus Ordo Seclorum and my American Gods homage-setting will probably have to wait until after Masks of the Mythos comes out with its Iron-level mechanics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-11T11:04:41-07:00","id":1317839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1317837#post1317837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I agree, but a decent amount of questions I've seen about the system have involved injuries and their conditions. I could easily see people wanting to roll on some kind of table to see what kind of injury was inflicted, though. A few different tables for each injury level would probably be popular.</div> </div> </div> </div>I saw some of those posts, and I think the problem comes from them assuming the game has far more mechanical rigidity than it does.<br /> <br /> Like they seem to assume &quot;Battered&quot; is a singular condition meant to always be a -1 injury but the book never tells you that because it's a meanie. Except that's not how it works. And a book that may imply it does will encourage people to think smaller and more limited.<br /> <br /> Now me, I'm aiming big. I'm gonna put up a setting hack for playing Magical Girls, Divine Edition","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-11T11:18:22-07:00","id":1317843,"title":"","content":"I think catalogues of birthright would also be interesting to see in the Nexus thingie.<br /> I'd like to write up something like &quot;10 famous Guides that will help you go from Zero to Hero&quot; or something like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-11T13:31:02-07:00","id":1317864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1317839#post1317839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now me, I'm aiming big. I'm gonna put up a setting hack for playing Magical Girls, Divine Edition</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that I am looking forward to! <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1317843#post1317843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think catalogues of birthright would also be interesting to see in the Nexus thingie.<br /> I'd like to write up something like &quot;10 famous Guides that will help you go from Zero to Hero&quot; or something like that.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is an excellent idea for a product!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-13T17:41:29-07:00","id":1318352,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1317864#post1317864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, that I am looking forward to!</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah shit, no pressure then. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-14T07:11:57-07:00","id":1318463,"title":"","content":"Maybe I should consider writing an Australian sourcebook. Not for the various Indigenous belief systems. More like what your average Australian yob is going to think and do when he or she finds out that she's the child or chosen of some hoity toity god from across the way.<br /> <br /> If nothing else because the look on Donnie Rhodes' face when a guy in boardshorts, thongs, a Billabong tank top, and Oakley sunglasses flip flopping his way over, slapping him on the shoulder, and saying &quot;Rhodesy! Welcome to Straya!&quot; would be friggin' <i>priceless</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2608-squee","name":"Squee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2608_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-19T00:22:24-07:00","id":1319410,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://support.drivethrurpg.com/hc/en-us/articles/360029385611-Storypath-Nexus-Frequently-Asked-Questions?mobile_site=true\" target=\"_blank\">There is already an FAQ online.</a><br /> <br /> I am not quite clear on how using new art for Nexus publications works, though. If I were to comission art for such a publication, would it also become the property of Onyx Path upon publication like the text of the product?<br /> <br /> That could use some clarification, as I might want to use the same art for non-Nexus publications as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/sunkencastles\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Sunken Castles, Evil Poodles</b></a> is creating Public Domain translations of German folklore!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://german-geek.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>A German Geek</b></a> - my gaming blog!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10279-j\u00fcrgen-hubert","name":"J\u00fcrgen Hubert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-04T17:50:12-07:00","id":1322315,"title":"","content":"Is this open yet and how do I reach it. I may not deepdive into it too much for Scion but I know that Trinity Core is on it's way to being published.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-04T17:59:19-07:00","id":1322319,"title":"","content":"Not yet, but Soon(tm)!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" targe