ith an encounter with a previously unknown school for Titan powered super sentai. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-05T22:05:26-07:00","id":1322560,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1317837#post1317837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I agree, but a decent amount of questions I've seen about the system have involved injuries and their conditions. I could easily see people wanting to roll on some kind of table to see what kind of injury was inflicted, though. A few different tables for each injury level would probably be popular.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would use such a table or a deck of fumble cards from another system to nudge the wounds along. <br /> <br /> Best regards","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not 