nyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1324056#post1324056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here is the Nexus project I spent the last year prepping for today! <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/282712/Lebor-Oe-In-Dea?src=newest_community\" target=\"_blank\">Lebor \u00d3e In Dea</a>, The Book of the Children of the Gods! Over 100 pages of T\u00faatha D\u00e9 Danann content, mostly put together from questions and suggestions from the Scion Discord.</div> </div> </div> </div>Excellent work Watcher! I've yet to go through it in its entirety, but it's amazing! It's great to see your take on a pantheon so near and dear to you, and I totally understand why you deserve that PHD in this stuff (not that there was really any doubt). You should make a forum thread about this project, because I know I'd definitely like to discuss it as I go through it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13079-wannabe-demon-lord","name":"Wannabe Demon Lord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-14T19:08:08-07:00","id":1324598,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wannabe Demon Lord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1324578#post1324578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\