:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Yes, you may translate Storypath Nexus Community Content Program content with the permission of the original content creator, which will require an agreement between the creator and the translator. This may result in a revenue sharing program as administered by DriveThruRPG.com.</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><br /> <br /> If anyone ever think about translating their materials to Brazilian Portuguese, please, count me in!<br /> <br /> That really got me by surprise (in a good way). I will soon publish some stuff in Portuguese and in English!<br /> <br /> Btw, about fonts. Can we use the same fonts used in the books (are they in the art pack? Not watched yet, just downloaded before I sleep). The background of the pages are also available?</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23841-hayashi","name":"Hayashi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23841_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-15T18:49:41-07:00","id":1324846,"title":"","content":"They are all in the pack, including a few arts.<br /> <br /> Talking about Brazilian Portugueses, estou interessado!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-16T07:21:58-07:00","id":1324960,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1324846#post1324846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They are all in the pack, including a few arts.<br /> <br /> Talking about Brazilian Portugueses, estou interessado!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sure!/Claro!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Myself</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <span style=\"color:#111111\">Btw, about fonts. Can we use the same fonts used in the books (are they in the art pack? Not watched yet, just downloaded before I sleep). The background of the pages are also available?</span></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#111111\"><br /> <br /> Just checked the zip files. Yes, the fonts are there.</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23841-hayashi","name":"Hayashi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23841_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-21T03:37:18-07:00","id":1326430,"title":"","content":"A question about this &quot;Material detailing monotheistic pantheons is not permitted.&quot; line:<br /> <br /> Is this merely about not writing them up as pantheons, or does this prohibit writing about all their mythological elements?<br /> <br /> For example, the Devil is pretty hard to avoid in German folklore. Could I write something about him on the Nexus, or is this prohibited?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/sunkencastles\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Sunken Castles, Evil Poodles</b></a> is creating Public Domain translations of German folklore!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://german-geek.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>A German Geek</b></a> - my gaming blog!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10279-j\u00fcrgen-hubert","name":"J\u00fcrgen Hubert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-03T13:09:44-07:00","id":1329151,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Watcher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1324056#post1324056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here is the Nexus project I spent the last year prepping for today! <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/282712/Lebor-Oe-In-Dea?src=newest_community\" target=\"_blank\">Lebor \u00d3e In Dea</a>, The Book of the Children of the Gods! Over 100 pages of T\u00faatha D\u00e9 Danann content, mostly put together from questions and suggestions from the Scion Discord.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a really great supplement. I'd really love to see something similar for the other pantheons, if anyone out there has the interest and expertise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-04T23:03:33-07:00","id":1329391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>J\u00fcrgen Hubert</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1326430#post1326430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A question about this &amp;quot;Material detailing monotheistic pantheons is not permitted.&amp;quot; line:<br /> <br /> Is this merely about not writing them up as pantheons, or does this prohibit writing about all their mythological elements?<br /> <br /> For example, the Devil is pretty hard to avoid in German folklore. Could I write something about him on the Nexus, or is this prohibited?</div> </div> </div> </div>Obviously can\u2019t comment on official policy, but my own view is that the devil of folklore is a pretty distinct figure from the one of serious Christian theology, or even theologic literary tradition. I\u2019d suggest including him with a note that people don\u2019t know whether or not he\u2019s the true Satan of Christian theology or just some other being using the monicker. As you aren\u2019t doing an Abrahamic Pantheon i\u2019d be surprised if it\u2019s a problem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-08T13:43:56-07:00","id":1329963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>J\u00fcrgen Hubert</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1326430#post1326430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A question about this &quot;Material detailing monotheistic pantheons is not permitted.&quot; line:<br /> <br /> Is this merely about not writing them up as pantheons, or does this prohibit writing about all their mythological elements?<br /> <br /> For example, the Devil is pretty hard to avoid in German folklore. Could I write something about him on the Nexus, or is this prohibited?</div> </div> </div> </div>Contact customer service about this. Trust me, it'll end better than working from forum speculation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-27T14:39:12-07:00","id":1344071,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/293097/The-Cortes-Divinas-of-Maria-Lionza?affiliate_id=498510\" target=\"_blank\">New Nexus Content!</a> </b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>The Cortes Divinas of Maria Lionza</b>, a vibrant and diverse pantheon from South America engaged constantly with their over 10 million followers, are now they're available for your Scion campaigns! Inthis detailed pantheon supplement, learn about the Cortes Divinas, their sites of power, their adversaries, and more. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">This product includes: </span></span></span><ul><li>The nine chief deities of the Cortes Divinas, their terra incognita, enemies, relationships, and more</li> <li>Two new antagonists designed specifically to challenge Cortes Divinas players</li> <li>A new pantheon specific purview, Trabajos, where mastery over the spirit realm brings wonders</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T03:36:51-07:00","id":1344161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1344071#post1344071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/293097/The-Cortes-Divinas-of-Maria-Lionza?affiliate_id=498510\" target=\"_blank\">New Nexus Content!</a> </b><br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>So, DriveThru won't let me leave a review yet, but I have to say... This is FANTASTIC","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T12:00:45-07:00","id":1344233,"title":"","content":"This is absolutely excellent. I think this might be the most purely benevolent pantheon in the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13079-wannabe-demon-lord","name":"Wannabe Demon Lord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T16:08:16-07:00","id":1344292,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wannabe Demon Lord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1317717-the-nexus-is-coming?p=1344233#post1344233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is absolutely excellent. I think this might be the most purely benevolent pantheon in the game.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair there\u2019s an anthropological reason for that. The least benevolent pantheons tend to be those that are non-continuous living traditions because they reflect ancient attitudes trapped in amber (see Theoi, etc). The old continuous living traditions are more mixed because they have the same legacy baggage + continuous moral evolution over time. The Cortes Divinas are a younger pantheon than any of the ones in the core and thus reflect comparatively more modern sensibilities without having to balance ancient narratives that sometimes lack those sensibilities the way the Deva (for example) do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T12:54:01-07:00","id":1344727,"title":"","content":"Definitely putting this on the to-buy list!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24769-magicjohnny","name":"Magicjohnny","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24769_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-05T20:34:10-08:00","id":1346343,"title":"","content":"Glad y'all like it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Religions Academic. Zoroastrian Convert.</i><br /> <b>Official Work:</b> Scion: Companion, Scion: Demigod.<br /> <b>Nexus Work:</b> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/293097/The-Cortes-Divinas-of-Maria-Lionza?cPath=8329_32938\" target=\"_blank\">Cortes Divinas of Maria Lionza</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17311-xhepablo","name":"xhepablo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17311_2.png","title":"Member","ran